---
---
<section class="custom-model-cta">
  <div class="custom-model-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="custom-model-content">
    <span class="custom-badge">Projeto Sob Medida</span>
    <h3 class="custom-model-title">
      Não encontrou o modelo perfeito para o seu segmento?
    </h3>
    <p class="custom-model-desc">
      Desenvolvemos uma estrutura exclusiva pensada nas necessidades do seu negócio, mantendo a mesma entrega rápida e qualidade profissional.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://wa.me/5541984940848?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20N%C3%A3o%20encontrei%20um%20modelo%20para%20o%20meu%20neg%C3%B3cio%20e%20gostaria%20de%20criar%20um%20personalizado."
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn-custom-whatsapp"
    >
      <svg class="whatsapp-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <use href="/Assets/icons.svg#icon-whatsapp"></use>
      </svg>
      Solicitar Modelo Personalizado
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap');

.custom-model-cta {
  position: relative;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 10, 78, 0.6) 0%, rgba(26, 20, 34, 0.85) 100%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35));
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 48px 24px;
  margin: 40px auto 60px;
  max-width: 1200px;
  text-align: center;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.custom-model-cta:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: var(--highlight, #a855f7);
  box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
}

/* Brilho neon sutil de fundo */
.custom-model-glow {
  position: absolute;
  top: -50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 300px;
  height: 300px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}

.custom-model-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.custom-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--highlight, #a855f7);
  background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
  padding: 5px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.custom-model-title {
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.custom-model-desc {
  font-size: 0.98rem;
  color: var(--text-muted, #c4b8d7);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.btn-custom-whatsapp {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background-color: var(--whatsapp, #25d366);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 14px 32px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.3);
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-custom-whatsapp:hover {
  background-color: #20bd5a;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.45);
}

.btn-custom-whatsapp:active {
  transform: scale(0.98);
}

.whatsapp-icon {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .custom-model-cta {
    padding: 32px 18px;
    margin: 30px 16px 30px 16px;
  }

  .btn-custom-whatsapp {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }
}
</style>